    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is40">
        <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e98">Caput 40</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1281A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_1@1-1">Consolamini.</quote>
            Quasi dicat: Quia rex vester non compatitur vobis, consolamini Christo. Potest ad gentes referri, de quibus Dominus per Zachariam: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e111" source="http://scta.info/resource/zac8_8@9-19">Ego congregabo populum orientis, et erunt mihi in populum, et ego ero illis in Deum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e116">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e118">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e120">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e122" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_2@1-3">Loquimini ad cor.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e125"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e126" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e129">Ad cor loquitur qui moestum consolatur, sicut de Sichen dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e131" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen24_45@16-24">Locutus est Sichen ad cor ejus, et consolatus est eam</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e136">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e138" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_2@4-4">Jerusalem.</quote>
            Jerusalem a Chaldaeis et Romanis corpore et anima; Ecclesia a persecutoribus corpore cruciata, animo angustiata.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e142">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e144" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_2@11-12">Malitia ejus.</quote>
            Malitia afflictio sicut illud: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e147" source="http://scta.info/resource/am3_6@10-17">Si est malum in civitate quod non faciat Dominus</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_2@13-14">Dimissa est.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e156"><seg type="qs">Causa consolationis, remissio peccatorum, <pb ed="#P" n="1281B"/></seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia purgata sunt et soluta per poenas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e168">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e170">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e172" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_3@1-2">Vox clamantis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e175"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e176" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e179">Hujus vocis memores, Judaei miserunt ad Joannem ut interrogarent eum: Tu quis es?</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e185">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_4">Omnis vallis exaltabitur. Qui se exaltat, humiliabitur, et qui se humiliat,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc. Hoc usque hodie in deserto gentilium Ecclesiarum clamant magistri.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e197">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e199">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e201">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e203" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_5@5-8">Et videbit omnis caro.</quote>
            De primo adventu subito ad secundum raptus dicit: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e206" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_5@5-8">Et videbit omnis caro.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e210">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e212" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_5@11-12">Os Domini.</quote>
            Prophetae qui praedicaverunt futurum Christum, scilicet salutare Dei nostri.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e217">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e219">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_6@6-7">Quid clamabo?</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e226"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e227" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e230">Non sine causa quaerit: cum enim se sponte obtulit, dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e232" source="http://scta.info/resource/is6_8@14-18">Ecce <pb ed="#P" n="1281C"/> ego, mitte me:</quote> populo suo dura nuntiavit, et nunc idem metuit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e239">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e241" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_6@8-9">Omnis caro.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e244"><seg type="qs">Qui portat imaginem terreni</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic homo, per aetatum successiones, amittit decorem et cadit in mortem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e253">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e255">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e257">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e259" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_8@6-7">Verbum autem Domini.</quote>
            Verbum Christus cum corpore suo, quod est Ecclesia.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e264">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e266">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_9@8-8">Sion.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e277">Per Sion et Jerusalem, apostolos et alios doctores intelligit, quos admonet ut quae a Domino acceperunt praedicent, et culmina virtutum ascendentes, verbo et exemplo doceant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e281">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e283">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e285">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e287" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_11@3-4">Gregem suum,</quote>
            etc. Nunc contemplatione, in futuro ipsa visione: nunc docendo, postea salvando vel satiando.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e291">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e293" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_11@16-16">Fetas.</quote>
            Doctores filios quotidie Deo parturientes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e298">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e300">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e302">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1281D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e306" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_12@1-3">Quis mensus est?</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e309"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e310" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e313">Ne de vocatione gentium dubitetur, magnitudo vocantis describitur.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e316">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e318" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_12@4-4">Pugillo.</quote>
            Pugillus, contractis digitis pugnus, palmus a pollice usque ad minimum digitum extenta manus, ut per palmum et pugillum coelos extentos et globum terrae noverimus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e324">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e326">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e328">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e330" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_13">Spiritum Domini super me, eo quod unxerit me ad annuntiandum mansuetis misit me: Et requiescet super eum Spiritus Domini.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e337">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e339">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e341">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e343" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_15@14-16">Quasi pulvis exiguus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e346"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e347" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e350"><seg type="qs">Hebraei hoc verbo tenuissimum pulverem significari putant</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et tam Graecae quam Latinae linguae paupertatem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e359">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e361">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e363">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e365" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_16@2-4">Libanus non sufficiet.</quote>
            Libanus mons <pb ed="#P" n="1282A"/> maximus et pascuis uberrimus et arboribus; sed etsi omnia ligna succidantur ad succendendum, et omnia animalia immolentur ad holocaustum, ad implendam vel placandam tamen majestatis potentiam non sufficiunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e372">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e374">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e376">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e378" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_19@1-1">Nunquid.</quote>
            Stultitiam gentium redarguit, ut ab idololatria recedant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e383">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e385">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e387">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e389" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_20@1-2">Forte lignum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e392"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e393" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e396">Hebraice mesuchan , quia genus ligni est imputribile, de quo maxime idola fiunt: hoc autem dicit ut, idolis reprobatis, suscipiatur doctrina Evangelii et reveletur gloria Domini, ut videat omnis caro salutare Dei.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e400">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e402">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e404">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e406" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_21@11-12">Ab initio.</quote>
            Legis Moysi, vel a principio mundi in ipsis creaturis quae omnes suum suo modo praedicant artificem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e412">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e414">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e416">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1282B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e420" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_22@3-4">Super gyrum.</quote>
            Hinc nonnulli terram quasi punctum et globum esse contendunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e424">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e426" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_22@10-11">Quasi locustae.</quote>
            In ejus comparatione, vel considerata terrae magnitudine.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e430">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e432" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_22@21-21">Tabernaculum.</quote>
            Hinc quoque in similitudinem sphaerae coelum esse contendunt, et ejus hemisphaerium terris imminere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e437">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e439">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e441">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e443" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_23">Qui dat secretorum. Stultam fecit Deus sapientiam hujus mundi,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            et hoc est: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e448" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_23@1-7">Qui dat secretorum scrutatores, quasi non sint<!-- check: Migne cites Icor1; text matches is40_23 --></quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e454">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e456">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e458">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e460" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_25@2-8">Cui assimilastis me, adaequastis me, dicit Sanctus.</quote>
            Quasi diceret: Quare similitudini Deum comparatis, nec ex creaturarum magnitudinem Deum creatorem intelligitis? si non creditis verbis, credite oculis vestris, et elementorum omnium <pb ed="#P" n="1282C"/> servitute omnipotentiam Domini cogitate.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e467">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e469">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e471">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e473" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_26@13-14">In numero.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e476"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e477" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e480">Illi numerata sunt quae Abraham numerare non potuit: et serviunt delegato officio, ut sol cursum coeli uno expleat anno, et caetera suo modo.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e483">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e485" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_26@15-16">Militiam eorum,</quote>
            etc. Angelos scilicet, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e488" source="http://scta.info/resource/dan7_10@9-12">Millia millium ministrabant ei</quote>. Inde et Dominus Sabaoth dicitur, id est militiae, vel exercituum, vel virtutum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e493">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e495">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e497">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e499" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_27@1-2">Quare dicis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e502"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e503" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e506"><seg type="qs">Cum haec propheta diceret</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sine judice sumus, et immerito affligimur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e514">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e516" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_27@9-10">Via mea.</quote>
            Bona opera, non pertinent ad Deum terrena, non considerat quid quisque agat. Inde injuste opprimitur, quasi jumenta et pisces, sine rectore.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e521">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e523">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e525">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1282D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e529" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_28@10-10">Creavit.</quote>
            Omnia novit, omnia continet, omnia majestate sua dispensat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e533">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e535" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_28@20-21">Sapientiae ejus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is40-Rd1e538"><name xml:id="gom-is40-Nd1e539" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e542">Ex hoc loco aliud apostoli sumptum videtur: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e544" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom11_33@9-16">Incomprehensibilia judicia ejus, et investigabiles viae ejus:</quote> quasi diceret: Solus Deus aeternus, impassibilis, caetera omnia deficient.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e551">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e553">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e555">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e557" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_30@1-2">Deficient pueri.</quote>
            Qui scilicet gaudent corporis sanitate, et pueritiam et adolescentiam putant esse perpetuam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is40-Dd1e562">
          <head xml:id="gom-is40-Hd1e564">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e566">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e568" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_31@6-6">Mutabunt.</quote>
            Ut sint fortes in Deo, fient debiles mundo, et post mortem carnis fient immortales.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is40-d1e572">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e574" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is40_31@10-11">Sicut aquilae.</quote>
            Sicut aquila secundum physicos, alliso ad silicem rostro, vetustate nimia aduncato <pb ed="#P" n="1283A"/> innovatur, sic qui vetustatem peccati per petram, quae est Christus, mortificant, mortui mundo innovantur Deo, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is40-Qd1e579" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps102_5@8-12">Renovabitur ut aquilae juventus tua</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
